  m_text: "I like Al Sarab Park more than anywhere else.\n\nAfter school, me and
    the boys go straight there. We stop by the cafeteria first, buy some good poratta's
    with chips and hot sauce wow it's really good, then sit on the benches like we
    own the place. \n\nWe laugh about stupid stuff, talk about teachers, talk about
    nothing, and the sun starts going down and everything feels\u2026 normal.\n\nThe
    park makes my chest feel lighter."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
