  m_text: "Why is a drawing like this here?\n\nI don\u2019t know if Adel drew it,
    or one of his friends did\u2026 but it has the same style.\n\nHe used to draw
    these little adventures all the time.\n\nI remember asking him why all the monsters
    looked the same?\n\nLater, he started changing their faces and bodies a little.\n\nI
    guess he was listening.\n\nI started liking his drawings after that.\n\nHe really
    was talented."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
